          "exampleId": "w:fluent#e-e68a382798a31881",
          "text": "Fluent readers sometimes think of dyslexia as a tendency to put letters in the wrong order, but it’s more complicated than that.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-mock-hubei-xiangyang-2026-03-senior-three-unified-survey-test",
