          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:fluent#e-f8e7df692bd98d2a",
          "text": "The tragedy is compounded by the fact that proven methods for teaching dyslexic students – which enabled Caroline to become a fluent reader by middle school – have been known for decades, but many American schools don’t use those scientifically supported instructional methods.",
